#68000
"Tower Foyer -- Entrance"
"You are in the entryway to an aged tower.  A fine carpet, brought here
from foreign climes, has been spread lengthwise in the room, covering
much of the wood-planked wooden floor.  Dangling from the dusty,
cobweb-draped ceiling is a surprisingly fine crystal chandelier.  An
eerie silence pervades the foyer.  The only interruption to the silence
is an occasional creaking noise, and the tinkling of the swaying
chandelier overhead.  A massive oaken door lies to the south, allowing
departure from the tower.
"
"[Zithuan] Reviewed
[Maegheera] Reviewed.
"
