trimmed bushes line the pathway, their brilliant flowers brightening up the
pale grey of the six-sided pathstones.  To the south stands a large one story
wooden building that has been painted a tasteful pale grey, almost the color
of the cobblestones.  Six large six-sided windows are evenly spaced across the
front of the house, and a six-sided door is set in the dead center of the
house.  An elaborate sign hangs above the door.
"
