"A lapidary's dream - or a thief's - lines the walls of this portion of the
hallway.  Cases of gemstones in both their raw and cut forms line the halls.
Arranged in alphabetical order, the stones each have a card next to them
explaining where the samples came from and the most popular uses for each.  To
the south, a silver-painted door has been set into the wall.  A small sign
hangs near the top.
"
"[Hedrack] Thieves are going to want to try something here.
[Orb] Sneaky bastards.  Fixed.
"
