#68055
"A Metallic Stairwell"
"The stairwell continues further up and down along numerous metal steps.  Dried
bloodstains and slimy footprints on the steps hint that someone has recently
climbed these stairs.  The handrails look exceedingly old and worn out, with
bits of their surface having peeled off.  At the top of the stairwell is a
door.  Hanging from the ceiling beside the door is a silver cord.
"
"[Maegheera] Reviewed.
"
