#68056
"A Confined Cell"
"Cobwebs and bugs infest each corner of this dank room.  The stone walls are
chipped and filled with many little holes.  Once painted in black and green,
they're now discolored and appear dull and gray.  Hanging off each wall are
rows of rusty chains and locks.  A couple of skeletons remain chained on the
eastern wall, as though absorbed by it.  A dusty wooden door lies on the
western part of the soiled floor.
"
