#68060
"Before an Old Tower"
"You stand before an enormous stone tower.  The blue paint on its facade
is cracked and peeling, leaving behind a decrepit, abandoned appearance
to the tower.  A large heavy oaken door to the north serves as the only
obvious entrance.  Long strands of ivy grow beside the door and up the
stone, covering much of the tower's front.  Dense, overgrown shrubs and
trees obstruct travel to the west and south.  To the east, a
plant-covered trail slopes its way downward.
"
"[Zithuan] Reviewed
[Maegheera] Reviewed.
"
