"An Overgrown Path"
"Chirping noises from the surrounding old-growth forest are the only
sounds disturbing the eerie stillness of the area.  Growing almost
uncontrollably along the trail are dark green ferns and shrubs.  Past the
towering trees to the northwest, you can can discern an aging tower whose
stone appears worn and eroded, even at such a distance.  You can move up
the trail eastward, or down the trail to the west.
"
